{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11206370","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11206370","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:3:1120637001:1":{"text":"没想到，我们会以这种方式和父亲重逢。","source_cn":"没想到，我们会以这种方式和父亲重逢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ADEAE67C19E6706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120637002:1":{"text":"以前他总是满世界寻宝，很少回家……他总说要找到无人发现的宝藏，带回财富，给我们最好的生活。","source_cn":"以前他总是满世界寻宝，很少回家……他总说要找到无人发现...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B1E529771D96C6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120637003:1":{"text":"你知道吗，哥哥……一直以来，我既希望能找到他，又害怕知道他的下落。","source_cn":"你知道吗，哥哥……一直以来，我既希望能找到他，又害怕知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4473D127D20F650A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120637004:1":{"text":"因为我怕他真的抛弃了我们，更怕他……死在外乡。","source_cn":"因为我怕他真的抛弃了我们，更怕他……死在外乡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A73F367C5457A22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120637005:1":{"text":"我明白你的感受……但，我们找到他了。","source_cn":"我明白你的感受……但，我们找到他了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9424811F0E6C4BE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120637006:1":{"text":"来吧，我们找些材料，立好墓碑。","source_cn":"来吧，我们找些材料，立好墓碑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEC405E32FAB97F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120637007:1":{"text":"相比于家乡，我觉得父亲更喜欢这里——这里有伊索米亚最壮美的落日。","source_cn":"相比于家乡，我觉得父亲更喜欢这里——这里有伊索米亚最壮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FCB64A4F2F8576D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120637008:1":{"text":"他说了，这是他人生旅途上的宝藏。","source_cn":"他说了，这是他人生旅途上的宝藏。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF07CA5810BE8C15F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120637009:1":{"text":"我们也来帮忙！","source_cn":"我们也来帮忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x727F872197E1833B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:宝藏猎人艾文":{"text":"宝藏猎人艾文","source":"宝藏猎人艾文","status":"source"},"speaker:宝藏猎人欧迪尔":{"text":"宝藏猎人欧迪尔","source":"宝藏猎人欧迪尔","status":"source"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"满满","source":"满满","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":3}}